#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Unit tests for OmniOpt's internal helper modules.

Covers the pure (side-effect free or easily mockable) functions in:

  * ``.helpers.py``          - value/lookup helpers
  * ``.pareto.py``           - Pareto front calculation
  * ``.random_generator.py`` - random point generation
  * ``.tpe.py``              - hyperopt TPE translation helpers
  * ``.general.py``          - console / webserver helpers

Every test is a ``def test_*() -> bool`` function returning ``True`` on
success. The module exits non-zero if any test fails, so it can be used as a
standalone test script (``python3 .tests/unit_tests``) or registered in the
test framework.
"""

